Change: procFingerprint prints the bytes of string and bytes literals as a
hash, and procFingerprintResolved names each callee by a hash the caller
supplies. The compile worker builds the Merkle hashes of init, loaded and
launch from it.
Upstream: not proposed.
Source: research/tour-init-identity (debug-print-merkle.patch).

